## SentenceStartClasses: form tag [keep[:prefix,...]]. At the start of a
## sentence the one-word name gets this reading, whatever the rules above
## say; with keep its own readings stay beside it and the tagger chooses
## (the odds are in probabilitats.dat); with keep:V only those whose tags
## begin with V (verbs) stay. NP00000: the classifier decides the class.
